Description: NVIDIA open kernel module with P2P support (DKMS)
 This package builds the NVIDIA open kernel modules with P2P (peer-to-peer)
 support enabled for RTX 4090 and RTX 5090 GPUs, using DKMS.
 .
 This is a modified version of the official NVIDIA open-gpu-kernel-modules
 that forces BAR1 P2P mode on consumer GPUs.
 .
 WARNING: IOMMU virtualization must be disabled (use iommu=pt kernel param).
 .
 Provided that you have the kernel header packages installed, the kernel
 module will be built for your running kernel and automatically rebuilt for
 any new kernel headers that are installed.
